# Measure of Central Tendency

Measures of Central Tendency describe the center point or typical value of a dataset.

They provide a single value that summarizes a set of data by identifying the central position within the dataset.

Types:
1. Mean (Average)
2. Median
3. Mode

---

# Mean

Mean = Sum of all values / Number of values

## Population Mean (μ)

Population Size = N

Formula:

