## Sample Mean (x̄)

Sample Size = n

n ≤ N

Formula:

            n
           Σ Xi
x̄ =       i=1
     ------------
           n

Where:
x̄ = Sample Mean
n  = Sample Size
Xi = Individual Observation

---

Example:

Data = [24, 32, 12, 48, 16, 20]

Sum = 24 + 32 + 12 + 48 + 16 + 20 = 152

Number of values = 6

Mean = 152 / 6

Mean = 25.33
